s it<br>Because the little yellow people have gone to new lands<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926280/extras/ccadfbd934770bb9ed8b9ca9b394312d.poster.avif?t=1752123157\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926280/extras/ccadfbd934770bb9ed8b9ca9b394312d.webm?t=1752123157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926280/extras/ccadfbd934770bb9ed8b9ca9b394312d.mp4?t=1752123157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Come to an end<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926280/extras/4f290175cc5bdd1bdf153eafe087fd88.poster.avif?t=1752123157\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926280/extras/4f290175cc5bdd1bdf153eafe087fd88.webm?t=1752123157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926280/extras/4f290175cc5bdd1bdf153eafe087fd88.mp4?t=1752123157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
